rative interludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/542c46d633e1c660e8ed8997f1e25770.poster.avif?t=1752656941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/542c46d633e1c660e8ed8997f1e25770.webm?t=1752656941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/542c46d633e1c660e8ed8997f1e25770.mp4?t=1752656941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade Mode</strong> is Story Mode without the narrative, aimed at letting players go after score in a quicker, more convenient way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Score Attack</strong> is a race against the clock to chase the highest score, while honing your skills at the game. Enemies spawn endlessly within a set time limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by 90s video games and anime, BIRDCAGE makes use of techniques such as sprite scaling, pre-rendered backgrounds and limited textures to mimic the look of early 3D games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/5aaefbc626d60b8c6a648fe092392c63.poster.avif?t=1752656941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/5aaefbc626d60b8c6a648fe092392c63.webm?t=1752656941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/5aaefbc626d60b8c6a648fe092392c63.mp4?t=1752656941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's soundtrack combines the sounds of 90s music hardware with modern synthesis and samples to create something authentic and exciting. <i>BIRDCAGE</i> features over an hour of dynamic music, hundreds of bespoke sound effects and retro-styled voice acting for stage bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2158550/extras/77da28bb605def8be1d9a213362f2c9a.webp?t=1752656941\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mankind has branched into space and two opposing factions have emerged. On one side, SELENE, in control of the Moon and what remains of Earth, on the other, RADON, in control of the space colony CAGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Led by Mother ROENTGEN, the RADON Daughters have ordered GENOME Control to create a new breed of weapon. A weapon to end Earth\u2019s reign and birth a new universe, the WORLD-EGG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep inside the CAGE, a pilot awakens in the cockpit of the HALCYON - an experimental RADON gunship. Inside the newly-hatched Pilot\u2019s mind, a Voice echoes: Destroy the WORLD-EGG.</p>",
